  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>A calling for one who would restore faith to a faithless land.</strong></p><p>The wretchedness of the world has extinguished the fire of faith in hearts of many. In some places, those who pray to the gods are called foolish or mad by those brave enough to spit on the Old Words. Yet unlike the cynics, the course of your meager life has offered an undeniable truth: it was not mere chance that brought you this far.</p><p>Your belief has spared you a grisly fate, lifted you from the jaws of death for a purpose unspoken yet known to you. It waits for a living instrument that will beckon the world back to it. Spread word of its power. Spread sight to the blind and truth to the liar's tongue. Change this world to one that befits the power you serve.</p>",
